{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7f7903ea8cf82c3ad6ba04d1dd9ca7ab03f826d63a936374d6e1311ac75e5ecc", "ja": "（三国志をテーマにしたドラマに出演する、ひなた。\n役作りのため、図書館で何冊か資料を借りてきた……）", "zh": "（日向要出演一部以《三国志》为主题的电视剧。为了塑造角色，她从图书馆借来了几本资料……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "b92935c9e01edc01c23f2e45ff64947ccd91feefbf841e3a48e731281e2ccdde", "ja": "{$P$}、\n今日は付き合ってくれて、ありがとうねぇ。", "zh": "{$P$}，今天谢谢你陪我一起哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "6b59245b3a3c5e600a0abd3fd36d57aa8ce9c42e2d4d7c9b69fba03955db6fb9", "ja": "三国志のこと、しっかり勉強できそうだよぉ。", "zh": "看来能好好学习《三国志》了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1003_p", "source_sha256": "51cc45f85f0b7351f825fdd836159503c811f1e944c0295de3d1ca4e2d32a4de", "ja": "それならよかった。\nしかし、たくさん本を借りてきたみたいだけど……。", "zh": "那就好。\n不过，你好像借了很多书回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "f203d801da92b62ad53fbcba30a71a5c77b20c111bdd29f1e4b325cc7aae593a", "ja": "うん。あたし、三国志って名前は聞いたことあるけど\nどんなお話かは、あんまり知らないんだわ。", "zh": "嗯。我听说过《三国志》这个名字，但不太清楚那是个什么故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "d6082d6e991bb88db10e723677fb7c711493bd6747eb86ac2cca6f67be6a5138", "ja": "それに、あたしが演じる劉備さんは\n今までに、いろんな人が演じてきたっしょや？", "zh": "而且，我要演的刘备这个角色，之前也有很多人演过吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "93d116f8a6175917dbb04eb4b59d58aeebfacb406a07d613df076f0642dd10c4", "ja": "そんなにすごい役を、何も知らないで演じるのは\n失礼なんじゃないかって思ってねぇ……。", "zh": "我觉得，明明什么都不了解，却去饰演那么了不起的角色，是不是有点失礼啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1007_p", "source_sha256": "88485b6329363fa150ac5cf690930f4727674d256e6c8fe619812dd824a13f19", "ja": "なるほどな。\nうん、確かにリスペクトは大事だな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n嗯，确实，尊重是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "b65a6663fe020d9533f33e637b5c59d291b9602634ffbc6233bfde979e2d9cf4", "ja": "えへへ。あとね、作品を見る人の中にも、三国志の\n世界が好きな人が、たくさんいると思うんだ。", "zh": "嘿嘿。而且我觉得，喜欢三国志世界的观众应该也有很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "f9c9a6d0b37c9584bc4047ca126de84f6d7f532b9e86125a6c948cb5695e5c57", "ja": "その人達が、がっかりしないように……\nあたしが、ちゃんと作品に向き合わなきゃって思って。", "zh": "为了不让那些人失望……\n我觉得自己也必须认真面对这部作品才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1010_p", "source_sha256": "52e8ec738fad87a49c8f502d2ece38aaa93bb1cb5922e5d25ffdde6e49cba6d1", "ja": "三国志ファンのことも考えて……。\nひなたは、すごいな！", "zh": "也要考虑到《三国志》的粉丝……日向，你真了不起啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "d7cf55342ee2d2f0aaef330db5b3b920e59b54fea78bfea30ea9480ca4e57118", "ja": "すごくなんて……。劉備さんが、どんなことを考えて\n生きてたのか、ちゃんと知りたいって思っただけだよ。", "zh": "哪有那么厉害……我只是想好好了解一下，刘备先生当时是抱着怎样的想法活着的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1012_p", "source_sha256": "83ba807d61a712abda5f006a9fcf2ca7504c5b099c9e61011a37963bb32cd8c5", "ja": "いや、素敵な考えだと思うよ。\nただ……その冊数を読むは大変じゃないか？", "zh": "不，我觉得这是个很棒的想法。\n只是……要读完那么多本，不会很辛苦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "90719387e5beab7a0baa752292ab596e4ec514d34e39e3babe47bda2d40cebbe", "ja": "大丈夫だよぉ。台本を読んだだけで、\n三国志の世界に引き込まれてしまったからねぇ。", "zh": "没问题的啦。光是看了剧本，\n我就已经被吸引进三国的世界里了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "240e9f431779d65ab73abe6eb2aba5e4454732425f9006fbdac0ef07cd54a93b", "ja": "きっと、あっという間だべさ。劉備さんが\nどんな人なのか、知るのが楽しみだよぉ。えへへ♪", "zh": "肯定一转眼就到了吧。真期待能知道刘备先生是个什么样的人呀。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0533_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f29abe6fefdb17ff54bf1e5412a0fec6c88d2612d6cfcb46867302272f57cfe6", "ja": "（ひなたの人を思いやる気持ちがあれば、きっと\n素敵な劉備になるだろう。今から撮影が楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（只要日向怀着体贴他人的心，一定能演好刘备。\n我已经开始期待拍摄了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
